    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mindbytes: Learn to Read Music is the most fun way to learn the how to read musical notation.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250020/extras/051043d246cb8d5f189bd554ddddf9b4.avif?t=1674418047\" /></span><br><br>\u2022 Learn each note on both the treble and bass clefs<br>\u2022 Learn what various musical notation symbols mean<br>\u2022 Click the notes to learn how they sound<br>\u2022 Think fast and challenge yourself to reach the highest score in the fast-paced and fun game mode<br>\u2022 Clicking the correct note earns you time, but getting the wrong answer causes a time penalty<br>\u2022 Get as many correct answers as possible before time runs out<br>\u2022 Reference flash-cards to look up any notes you haven't memorised yet",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Mindbytes: Learn to Read Music is the most fun way to learn the how to read musical notation.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250020/extras/051043d246cb8d5f189bd554ddddf9b4.avif?t=1674418047\" /></span><br><br>\u2022 Learn each note on both the treble and bass clefs<br>\u2022 Learn what various musical notation symbols mean<br>\u2022 Click the notes to learn how they sound<br>\u2022 Think fast and challenge yourself to reach the highest score in the fast-paced and fun game mode<br>\u2022 Clicking the correct note earns you time, but getting the wrong answer causes a time penalty<br>\u2022 Get as many correct answers as possible before time runs out<br>\u2022 Reference flash-cards to look up any notes you haven't memorised yet",
    "short_description": "The most fun way to learn the how to read musical notation.",
